    "Experimental document-owner configuration only. No production switch or complete renderer/host/library claim.",
    "Windows wcstol remains a system CRT dependency through audited Rust FFI. CString marshaling, SAMI insertion dispatch, WebVTT regex/class handling, renderer HTML tag tokenization and remaining native adapters are transitional.",
    "Finite Windows Unicode MSVC14.44 x86/x64 evidence. No claim for allocator/new-handler reentry, injected faults, arbitrary locale/global mutation, non-Unicode builds or non-Windows whole-renderer behavior.",
    "Caller pointer validity, initialized input spans and writable output spans remain unsafe FFI preconditions. Metadata/representation bounds are checked; allocation failure and reentry remain open.",
